&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
