&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 150.2px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 14.666666666666666666666666667px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2024年５月９日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 14.666666666666666666666666667px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;関東財務局長に提出&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:OtherReferenceInformationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h1&gt;第二部【提出会社の保証会社等の情報】&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock>
